// Example structure for future AI integration.
//
// Recommended architecture:
//
// Frontend
//    |
//    v
// Express API  --->  Python ML service
//    |                    |
//    v                    v
// MySQL              Model prediction
//
// Example response from the ML service:
// {
//   "category": "E-Waste",
//   "confidence": 0.97,
//   "recommendation": "Send to an authorized e-waste facility"
// }
//
// You can later create:
// POST /api/ai/classify
//
// Do not put the ML model directly inside Express unless you have a
// specific reason to do so. A small Python FastAPI/Flask service is
// easier for scikit-learn/PyTorch/TensorFlow models.
